              "content": {
                "html": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">The BNMS Mentorship Programme connects members from across the nuclear medicine community with experienced professionals who can provide guidance, encouragement and support.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Through one-to-one mentoring relationships, the programme helps members build confidence, explore career opportunities and achieve their personal and professional goals.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Whether you are seeking guidance or would like to support the development of others, mentoring provides an opportunity to learn, share experience and strengthen the future of nuclear medicine.</span></p>",
