              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Looking for guidance, support or career development?</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">The programme is open to BNMS members from all professional groups and career stages.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Your mentor can help you:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Build confidence</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Explore career opportunities</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Develop professional skills</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Discuss challenges and opportunities</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Identify development goals</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Expand your professional network</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Gain support from an experienced colleague</span></p></li></ul><p></p>",
