              "content": {
                "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Help support the next generation of professionals.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Experienced BNMS members play an important role in developing future colleagues and strengthening the profession.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">As a mentor you can:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Share your experience and expertise</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Support professional development</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Help develop future leaders</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Build new professional relationships</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Contribute to the wider profession</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Give something back to the nuclear medicine community</span></p></li></ul><p></p>",
